            "Check and save": [
                "Ellen\u0151rz\u00e9s \u00e9s ment\u00e9s"
            ],
            "Connect a mailing-list service once; then any form can add the people who fill it in to one of your lists (the form block's settings \u2192 After sending). Keys are checked with the service, stored encrypted on this site and never shown again.": [
                "Csatlakoztasson egy levelez\u0151list\u00e1s szolg\u00e1ltat\u00e1st egyszer; ezut\u00e1n b\u00e1rmelyik \u0171rlap hozz\u00e1adhatja a kit\u00f6lt\u0151ket valamelyik list\u00e1j\u00e1hoz (az \u0171rlapblokk be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sai \u2192 K\u00fcld\u00e9s ut\u00e1n). A kulcsokat a rendszer ellen\u0151rzi a szolg\u00e1ltat\u00e1ssal, titkos\u00edtva t\u00e1rolja ezen az oldalon, \u00e9s soha t\u00f6bb\u00e9 nem jelen\u00edti meg."
            ],
            "Send form submissions and button clicks to your analytics with no code. Leave an ID empty to skip that service. Buttons get a \"Conversion event\" field in their Advanced panel. With the cookie banner on, nothing loads until the visitor agrees.": [
                "K\u00fcldje el az \u0171rlapbek\u00fcld\u00e9seket \u00e9s a gombkattint\u00e1sokat az elemz\u0151rendszer\u00e9be k\u00f3dol\u00e1s n\u00e9lk\u00fcl. Hagyjon \u00fcresen egy azonos\u00edt\u00f3t az adott szolg\u00e1ltat\u00e1s kihagy\u00e1s\u00e1hoz. A gombok egy \u201eKonverzi\u00f3s esem\u00e9ny\u201d mez\u0151t kapnak a Speci\u00e1lis panelen. Bekapcsolt s\u00fctis\u00e1v mellett semmi sem t\u00f6lt\u0151dik be, am\u00edg a l\u00e1togat\u00f3 bele nem egyezik."
            ],
            "Google Analytics 4 measurement ID": [
                "Google Analytics 4 m\u00e9r\u00e9si azonos\u00edt\u00f3"
            ],
            "Google Tag Manager container ID": [
                "Google Tag Manager t\u00e1rol\u00f3azonos\u00edt\u00f3"
            ],
            "Meta Pixel ID (the number shown in Meta Events Manager)": [
                "Meta Pixel azonos\u00edt\u00f3 (a Meta Esem\u00e9nykezel\u0151ben l\u00e1that\u00f3 sz\u00e1m)"
            ],
            "Load these tags on my site": [
                "Ezen c\u00edmk\u00e9k bet\u00f6lt\u00e9se a webhelyemre"
            ],
            "Switch off if your theme or another plugin already adds them; events are still sent.": [
                "Kapcsolja ki, ha a sablonja vagy egy m\u00e1sik b\u0151v\u00edtm\u00e9ny m\u00e1r hozz\u00e1adja \u0151ket; a esem\u00e9nyek tov\u00e1bbra is elk\u00fcld\u00e9sre ker\u00fclnek."
            ],
            "Event name for form submissions": [
                "Esem\u00e9nyn\u00e9v az \u0171rlapbek\u00fcld\u00e9sekhez"
            ],
            "The banner is a popup you design with blocks. Its buttons link to #consent-accept, #consent-reject and #consent-save (with tick boxes named analytics and marketing for \"save\"); a link to #consent-open anywhere shows it again. Until a visitor accepts, tracking tags do not load, Google Consent Mode stays \"denied\", and the scripts you list stay switched off.": [
                "A banner egy olyan felugr\u00f3 ablak, amelyet blokkokkal tervezhet meg. Gombjai a #consent-accept, #consent-reject \u00e9s #consent-save c\u00edmk\u00e9kre hivatkoznak (a \u201ement\u00e9s\u201d eset\u00e9ben analytics \u00e9s marketing nev\u0171 jel\u00f6l\u0151n\u00e9gyzetekkel); a b\u00e1rhol elhelyezett #consent-open hivatkoz\u00e1s ism\u00e9t megjelen\u00edti. Am\u00edg a l\u00e1togat\u00f3 nem fogadja el, a k\u00f6vet\u0151k\u00f3dok nem t\u00f6lt\u0151dnek be, a Google Consent Mode \u201emegtagadva\u201d \u00e1llapotban marad, \u00e9s a felsorolt szkriptek kikapcsolva maradnak."
            ],
            "Create a ready-made banner": [
                "K\u00e9sz banner l\u00e9trehoz\u00e1sa"
            ],
            "Show a cookie banner": [
                "Cookie-szalag megjelen\u00edt\u00e9se"
            ],
            "Banner": [
                "Banner"
            ],
            "Choose a popup\u2026": [
                "V\u00e1lasszon felugr\u00f3 ablakot\u2026"
            ],
            "%s (draft)": [
                "%s (piszkozat)"
            ],
            "Edit the banner": [
                "Banner szerkeszt\u00e9se"
            ],
            "Remember the choice for (days)": [
                "Eml\u00e9kezzen a v\u00e1laszt\u00e1sra (nap) m\u00falva"
            ],
            "Outside the European Union, the EEA and the UK: load tracking until the visitor says no": [
                "Az Eur\u00f3pai Uni\u00f3n, az EGT-n \u00e9s az Egyes\u00fclt Kir\u00e1lys\u00e1gon k\u00edv\u00fcl: bet\u00f6lt\u00e9s-k\u00f6vet\u00e9s, am\u00edg a l\u00e1togat\u00f3 nem mond nemet"
            ],
            "Off: every visitor must agree first (the strictest rule, and the default). On: only when your host or CDN reports the visitor's country (for example Cloudflare's CF-IPCountry header) and it is outside the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland. The banner is still shown, and an unknown country is treated as inside the EU.": [
                "Ki: minden l\u00e1togat\u00f3nak el\u0151sz\u00f6r bele kell egyeznie (a legszigor\u00fabb szab\u00e1ly, egyben az alap\u00e9rtelmezett). Be: csak akkor, ha a t\u00e1rhelyszolg\u00e1ltat\u00f3 vagy a CDN jelent\u00e9se alapj\u00e1n a l\u00e1togat\u00f3 orsz\u00e1ga (p\u00e9ld\u00e1ul a Cloudflare CF-IPCountry fejl\u00e9ce) k\u00edv\u00fcl esik az EU-n, az EGT-n, az Egyes\u00fclt Kir\u00e1lys\u00e1gon \u00e9s Sv\u00e1jcon. A szalagcikk tov\u00e1bbra is megjelenik, \u00e9s a ismeretlen orsz\u00e1got az EU-n bel\u00fclinek tekintj\u00fck."
            ],
            "Other scripts to hold until consent (handle:analytics or handle:marketing, comma separated)": [
                "M\u00e1s szkriptek a hozz\u00e1j\u00e1rul\u00e1sig (kezel\u0151:analytics vagy kezel\u0151:marketing, vessz\u0151vel elv\u00e1lasztva)"
            ],
